   "AnchorBarGrid"], Cell["ExpandComplexMomenta", "ObjectName"],
  Cell["Expands supported legacy complex-shift formulas with specified masses \
and companion legs.", "Notes"],
  Cell[TextData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"ExpandComplexMomenta", "[", "expr",
         ",", " ", "{", "i", ",", " ", "mi", "}", ",", " ", "k", ",", " ",
         "{", "j", ",", " ", "mj", "}", ",", " ", "l", ",", " ", "mik",
         "]"}]], "InlineFormula"], "  ", "applies the implemented shift \
identities for the chosen mass pattern."}], "Usage"],
  Cell["Details", "NotesSection"], Cell["The pair arguments identify the \
shifted legs and their masses; k and l identify the companion legs used by \
the construction, and mik is the corresponding channel mass.", "Notes"],
  Cell["This is a collection of specialized massive/massless cases. It is not \
a generic solver for an arbitrary complex deformation. Preserve the original \
expression and verify the assumptions when using it.", "Notes"],
  Cell["For an expression without any matching shifted object, the input \
remains unchanged.", "Notes"], Cell["Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection"],
  Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["Load HEPCAT", "ExampleSubsection"],
     Cell["Evaluate this setup once before the examples. The paths refer to \
the local HEPCAT checkout; no model parameters are assigned global numerical \
values.", "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"If", "[", "!", "StringQ",
         "[", "Global`$HEPCATpath", "]", " ", "||", " ", "!", "DirectoryQ",
         "[", "Global`$HEPCATpath", "]", ",", "\n", " ", " ",
         "Global`$HEPCATpath", " ", "=", " ", "FileNameJoin", "[", "{",
         "First", "[", "PacletFind", "[", "\"HEPCAT\"", "]", "]", "[",
         "\"Location\"", "]", ",", " ", "\"source\"", "}", "]", "]", ";",
         "\n", "If", "[", "!", "MemberQ", "[", "$Packages", ",", " ",
         "\"ConstructiveDiagrams`\"", "]", ",", "\n", " ", " ", "Get", "[",
         "FileNameJoin", "[", "{", "Global`$HEPCATpath", ",", " ",
         "\"HEPCAT.wl\"", "}", "]", "]", "]", ";", "\n", "hepcatDirectory",
         " ", "=", " ", "ParentDirectory", "[", "Global`$HEPCATpath", "]",
         ";", "\n", "modelDirectory", " ", "=", " ", "FileNameJoin", "[",
         "{", "hepcatDirectory", ",", " ", "\"models\"", "}", "]", ";", "\n",
         "feynmanModelDirectory", " ", "=", " ", "FileNameJoin", "[", "{",
         "hepcatDirectory", ",", " ", "\"model_feynman\"", "}", "]", ";"}]],
      "Input", InitializationCell -> True]}, Open]],
  Cell["Basic Examples", "ExampleSection"], Cell["Expand a scalar-product \
marker in the supported massive zero-channel case.", "ExampleText"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"ExpandComplexMomenta", "[", "MomProdHat1", "[", "1",
      ",", " ", "5", "]", ",", " ", "{", "1", ",", " ", "m1", "}", ",", " ",
      "3", ",", " ", "{", "2", ",", " ", "m2", "}", ",", " ", "4", ",", " ",
      "0", "]"}]], "Input"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"-", RowBox[{SubscriptBox["p", "3"], ".",
